      "text": "Design Ticketmaster/BookMyShow/any booking like use cases",
      "fontSize": 78.66666666666578,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design Ticketmaster/BookMyShow/any booking like use cases",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mZgqmA5xoeaXXi1KzrWFV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9289.061700291473,
      "y": 11855.679994239137,
      "width": 2029.0276614466352,
      "height": 154.4443766276055,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Bb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 237127545,
      "version": 402,
      "versionNonce": 2141909465,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Tickemaster will is a online platform allow user to purchase the tickets \nfor any specific concerts or movies or event, theatre , live comedy concert",
      "fontSize": 61.77775065104213,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Tickemaster will is a online platform allow user to purchase the tickets \nfor any specific concerts or movies or event, theatre , live comedy concert",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YdGMRFgl06vGgOGvpAQEF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9282.839278009575,
      "y": 12403.79102481775,
      "width": 750.5362548828125,
      "height": 823.9999999999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Bc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1698492505,
      "version": 711,
      "versionNonce": 1511552055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements \n\n1) Functional\n    a) Book tickets\n    b) enroll events (shows, movies, hotel with rooms and etc)\n    c) search \n\n\n2) Non Fucntional\n - read>> write\n - search (low letency)\n- CAP (consistent >> availibility)\n- scalbility to handle surges for popular events\n\n\n\nOut scope \n- Compliances (GDPR)\n- fult talerance \n\ni will come back to this in some time.\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 27.466666666666665,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements \n\n1) Functional\n    a) Book tickets\n    b) enroll events (shows, movies, hotel with rooms and etc)\n    c) search \n\n\n2) Non Fucntional\n - read>> write\n - search (low letency)\n- CAP (consistent >> availibility)\n- scalbility to handle surges for popular events\n\n\n\nOut scope \n- Compliances (GDPR)\n- fult talerance \n\ni will come back to this in some time.\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xsWodgVV0F0RslVAi5mSR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8338.172743585747,
      "y": 12399.457704200075,
      "width": 500.90380859375,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Bd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1489993017,
      "version": 278,
      "versionNonce": 1224822457,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core entities \n - Event (movie)\n - Venue\n - users /// not added in entities\n - Ticket\n - Performer ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core entities \n - Event (movie)\n - Venue\n - users /// not added in entities\n - Ticket\n - Performer ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "d5dN2KAi2M8ORO4egJ65Y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8343.50602605645,
      "y": 12733.79102481775,
      "width": 1101.275634765625,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Be",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1480420889,
      "version": 395,
      "versionNonce": 1032508759,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "API\n- get \n        request : /event/:eventId  -> \n        response:        event & venue & performer & metadata & ticket[]\n\n- get\n    search \nreq:    serach/{params}\nresp: metadata for my search query\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API\n- get \n        request : /event/:eventId  -> \n        response:        event & venue & performer & metadata & ticket[]\n\n- get\n    search \nreq:    serach/{params}\nresp: metadata for my search query\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
