    {
      "id": "u7EEQXFDnhAqevBfM0_Zr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9369.505941876214,
      "y": 14568.889079703611,
      "width": 1105.0556640625,
      "height": 1170,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Cy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1737810393,
      "version": 1096,
      "versionNonce": 657084279,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Function Requirement\n- user can set his or her preferences (age, gender, location etc...)\n- user can view a stack of potential matches \n        - match on the basis of perference \n        - as per your geo location\n- user can swipe left (no) or right (yes)\n- 2 users matches(swipe right) then they should get the notification.\n\nOut of scope:\n- creating the whole profile \n- uploading the pics etc.\n\nNon functional Requirement \n- CAP -- consistency for swipe\n- low letency stack loading (>300 ms)\n- scale to handle very high write throughtput (Swipe)\n- every day per  user swipes 100 stacks \n- 100M -- 100m * 100 swipe every day\n\n\nDaily active user 10M (DAU)\n- scale - 10DMU\n\nConstraint \n- Avoid duplicate profile\n- avoid cross gender profiles    ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Function Requirement\n- user can set his or her preferences (age, gender, location etc...)\n- user can view a stack of potential matches \n        - match on the basis of perference \n        - as per your geo location\n- user can swipe left (no) or right (yes)\n- 2 users matches(swipe right) then they should get the notification.\n\nOut of scope:\n- creating the whole profile \n- uploading the pics etc.\n\nNon functional Requirement \n- CAP -- consistency for swipe\n- low letency stack loading (>300 ms)\n- scale to handle very high write throughtput (Swipe)\n- every day per  user swipes 100 stacks \n- 100M -- 100m * 100 swipe every day\n\n\nDaily active user 10M (DAU)\n- scale - 10DMU\n\nConstraint \n- Avoid duplicate profile\n- avoid cross gender profiles    ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "K5dOx1Ov42itn7JfoUcxQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8057.505941876213,
      "y": 14538.555746370279,
      "width": 551.8798217773438,
      "height": 1215,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Cz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2116894393,
      "version": 434,
      "versionNonce": 1929234297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Entities\n- profile\n- swipe\n- match\n\n\nAPI\n- post /profiles\n{\nminage:\nmaxage:\nlocation(Geo index):\ngender:\n.....\n}\n\n- get\nstack/? longitute-lattitude\nuser-id (should not be part of url).\nJWT token (your auth token)\n\npost\n /swipes/:userId(in jwt)\n{\nmatch:like or not\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entities\n- profile\n- swipe\n- match\n\n\nAPI\n- post /profiles\n{\nminage:\nmaxage:\nlocation(Geo index):\ngender:\n.....\n}\n\n- get\nstack/? longitute-lattitude\nuser-id (should not be part of url).\nJWT token (your auth token)\n\npost\n /swipes/:userId(in jwt)\n{\nmatch:like or not\n}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
