      "text": "Casandra\n- write to the log graph(disk)\n- memorytable(may be on RAM)\n- Ack the write\n- periodically , start writing to db and flush the memmeory\n- append at last (log(n))\n",
      "fontSize": 37.77777390252991,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Casandra\n- write to the log graph(disk)\n- memorytable(may be on RAM)\n- Ack the write\n- periodically , start writing to db and flush the memmeory\n- append at last (log(n))\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
