    },
    {
      "id": "IuN-lVP0b1TAu5E9ok8Lf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9680.247315755787,
      "y": 28587.71303823675,
      "width": 846.7438235214778,
      "height": 296.46875000000006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Jp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1081369017,
      "version": 228,
      "versionNonce": 1889097977,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Leader Replica Assignment: Each partition has a designated\nleader replica, which resides on a broker. This leader replica\nhandles all write requests and, by default, read requests for\nthe partition (though Kafka 2.4+ supports consumer reads from\nfollower replicas for latency optimization). The assignment of\nthe leader replica is managed centrally by the cluster\ncontroller, which ensures that each partition's leader replica is\neffectively distributed across the cluster to balance the load.",
      "fontSize": 29.646874999999998,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Leader Replica Assignment: Each partition has a designated leader replica, which resides on a broker. This leader replica handles all write requests and, by default, read requests for the partition (though Kafka 2.4+ supports consumer reads from follower replicas for latency optimization). The assignment of the leader replica is managed centrally by the cluster controller, which ensures that each partition's leader replica is effectively distributed across the cluster to balance the load.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pYsA3hLmKbimbdQqy168_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8672.448445824819,
      "y": 28589.35366323675,
      "width": 916.1097299225478,
      "height": 290.78124999999983,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Jq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 852607641,
      "version": 575,
      "versionNonce": 50302743,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Follower Replication: Alongside the leader replica, several\nfollower replicas exist for each partition, residing on different\nbrokers. These followers do not handle direct client requests;\ninstead, they passively replicate the data from the leader\nreplica. By replicating the messages received by the leader\nreplica, these followers act as backups, ready to take over\nshould the leader replica fail.",
      "fontSize": 33.23214285714284,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Follower Replication: Alongside the leader replica, several follower replicas exist for each partition, residing on different brokers. These followers do not handle direct client requests; instead, they passively replicate the data from the leader replica. By replicating the messages received by the leader replica, these followers act as backups, ready to take over should the leader replica fail.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jLLxCDE8HKWXAg435oSUj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -9685.294160238209,
      "y": 28987.27553823675,
      "width": 927.2399576732088,
      "height": 289.1328124999999,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Jr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 948963193,
      "version": 489,
      "versionNonce": 1507185113,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Synchronization and Consistency: Followers continuously sync\nwith the leader replica to ensure they have the latest set of\nmessages appended to the partition log. This synchronization\nis crucial for maintaining consistency across the cluster. If the\nleader replica fails, one of the follower replicas that has been\nfully synced can be quickly promoted to be the new leader,\nminimizing downtime and data loss.",
      "fontSize": 33.04374999999998,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Synchronization and Consistency: Followers continuously sync with the leader replica to ensure they have the latest set of messages appended to the partition log. This synchronization is crucial for maintaining consistency across the cluster. If the leader replica fails, one of the follower replicas that has been fully synced can be quickly promoted to be the new leader, minimizing downtime and data loss.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BhbmLePj4GffoW8ETojGb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8666.967988363209,
      "y": 29012.21303823675,
      "width": 967.5669722784132,
      "height": 255.25000000000006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Js",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2079502425,
      "version": 375,
      "versionNonce": 881562679,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Controller's Role in Replication: The controller within the Kafka\ncluster manages this replication process. It monitors the health\nof all brokers and manages the leadership and replication\ndynamics. When a broker fails, the controller reassigns the\nleader role to one of the in-sync follower replicas to ensure\ncontinued availability of the partition.",
      "fontSize": 34.03333333333332,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Controller's Role in Replication: The controller within the Kafka cluster manages this replication process. It monitors the health of all brokers and manages the leadership and replication dynamics. When a broker fails, the controller reassigns the leader role to one of the in-sync follower replicas to ensure continued availability of the partition.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nOKDxATQEciMjAmukj2V-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -8359.62014900774,
      "y": 25356.10366323675,
      "width": 728.363525390625,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Jt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 315440441,
      "version": 242,
      "versionNonce": 1523592889,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784790718808,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "offset is committed to kakfa server (centralized controller)\njust in case partition or broker goes down \n\nthe another partition can process it from the latest offset",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "offset is committed to kakfa server (centralized controller)\njust in case partition or broker goes down \n\nthe another partition can process it from the latest offset",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
