      "fontSize": 32.911721303077385,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Uber/ola/rapido/fedex is a ride-sharing platforms that connect passengers with drivers who offer transportation services \nin personal vehicles. It allows users to book rides on-demand from their smartphones, matching them \nwith a nearby driver who will take them from their location to their desired destination.",
