      "fontSize": 26.32937704246191,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Primary Goal: Satisfy\nNon-functional Requirements",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "oMl8_UnICfHe8GNMZCWUe",
      "originalText": "Primary Goal: Satisfy\nNon-functional Requirements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_aJ4bfpeq3LiGPWseAqDI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -11145.682792777985,
      "y": 38846.13849661988,
      "width": 1813.535888671875,
      "height": 1305,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0Rf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1473557553,
      "version": 1592,
      "versionNonce": 370045023,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785410440179,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional requirement  - 10min lot of discussion has to happen here about it with interviewer\n\n    - User should be able to input start and end location (geo -- lang, latitude) and get the estimate.\n    - User should be able to request a ride based on these estimates - (car - 140, bike 20, 3Wheel-100)\n    - Diver should be able to accept/deny a request and navigate to pick you up \n\n\n-- out scope --\n -  mutiple type of car (saddan, eco...)\n - rating servies\n - payment servies\n - scheduling the car for ltr time\n\n\nNon functional requirement   - 5,10 mins \n- Availibity, scalabity, low letacy ?? ....\n- CAP theorem   --\n- - low latency - matching < 1min for match or fail \n- consistency for rider vs ride ( ride:rider 1:1)\n- high availiable outside the matching\n- handles high thorughput , surge(peak hour) of booking on special event\n        100s of thousands of request for given reason\n\n \n --- out  scope ---\nlogging , ci/cd, monitering , compliance GDPR, HIPPA \n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional requirement  - 10min lot of discussion has to happen here about it with interviewer\n\n    - User should be able to input start and end location (geo -- lang, latitude) and get the estimate.\n    - User should be able to request a ride based on these estimates - (car - 140, bike 20, 3Wheel-100)\n    - Diver should be able to accept/deny a request and navigate to pick you up \n\n\n-- out scope --\n -  mutiple type of car (saddan, eco...)\n - rating servies\n - payment servies\n - scheduling the car for ltr time\n\n\nNon functional requirement   - 5,10 mins \n- Availibity, scalabity, low letacy ?? ....\n- CAP theorem   --\n- - low latency - matching < 1min for match or fail \n- consistency for rider vs ride ( ride:rider 1:1)\n- high availiable outside the matching\n- handles high thorughput , surge(peak hour) of booking on special event\n        100s of thousands of request for given reason\n\n \n --- out  scope ---\nlogging , ci/cd, monitering , compliance GDPR, HIPPA \n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
